WEBVTT

00:01:29.135 --> 00:01:34.239
And she reminded me
that my favorite color was blue.

00:01:34.752 --> 00:01:39.119
The fact that my favorite color
now is blue, but I'm still gay --

00:01:39.143 --> 00:01:42.372
(Laughter)

00:01:42.396 --> 00:01:45.247
is evidence of both my mother's influence

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:46.425
and its limits.

00:01:46.449 --> 00:01:48.666
(Laughter)

00:01:48.690 --> 00:01:55.109
(Applause)

00:01:55.704 --> 00:01:58.374
When I was little, my mother used to say,

00:01:58.398 --> 00:02:02.985
"The love you have for your children
is like no other feeling in the world.